WEBVTT

00:38:59.685 --> 00:39:03.670
Health care would be a really good one
for countries to collaborate,

00:39:03.694 --> 00:39:06.874
because it's definitely not
a zero-sum game.

00:39:06.898 --> 00:39:08.712
Education might be another.

00:39:08.736 --> 00:39:12.070
CA: Health care is definitely a case
where I've heard the argument made

00:39:12.094 --> 00:39:16.641
that massive success of AI in China
can help everyone else around the world,

00:39:16.665 --> 00:39:18.355
if it is a data game.

00:39:18.379 --> 00:39:20.450
At the moment,
people with obscure diseases,

00:39:20.474 --> 00:39:22.712
there's just not that much data out there

00:39:22.736 --> 00:39:25.454
for AI to play a role
in better treatments,

00:39:25.478 --> 00:39:27.268
but in a country as large as China,

00:39:27.292 --> 00:39:30.530
that may be where
the key insights come from